<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Customer Satisfaction - Car Mantri</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn how Car Mantri keeps customer satisfaction high through clear communication, reliable repairs, and dependable after-service support."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("../partials/navbar") %>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Customer Satisfaction</h2>
        <p class="section-text">
          Customer satisfaction is not an extra feature at Car Mantri. It is the
          standard we use for every repair, service visit, and follow-up. From
          the first call to the final handover, we keep the process clear,
          respectful, and focused on your vehicle's actual needs.
        </p>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 22px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">How we keep customers happy</h3>
          <ul style="line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; color: #1f2937">
            <li>Clear updates before, during, and after service work</li>
            <li>Honest estimates so you can decide with confidence</li>
            <li>Repair recommendations based on actual inspection results</li>
            <li>Quick responses when you need support or follow-up help</li>
            <li>Quality checks to reduce delays and avoid repeat visits</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 18px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">What you get from us</h3>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #1f2937">
            We aim to make every visit simple to understand. That means we
            explain the problem, share the service plan, and keep you updated if
            anything changes while the work is in progress.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 0; color: #1f2937">
            You should never feel uncertain about what your vehicle needs or why
            a repair was recommended. Clear communication is part of the service.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 18px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">Our promise</h3>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1f2937">
            We want each customer to leave with a safe vehicle, a clear
            explanation of the work completed, and confidence that they were
            treated fairly.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 0; color: #1f2937">
            That is how we turn a one-time visit into long-term trust.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include("../partials/footer") %>
    <%- include("../partials/loginModal") %>
  </body>
</html>
